# Dependencies
# Directories and symlinks: a worktree's `node_modules` is often a link to a
# shared tree, and `node_modules/` (with the slash) does not match a symlink.
node_modules
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Expo / React Native
.expo/
.expo-shared/
expo-env.d.ts
web-build/
.metro-health-check*
*.tsbuildinfo

